(GPL-2.0-only), U-Boot (GPL-2.0-or-later), Trusted Firmware-A
(BSD-3-Clause), the Seekwave SWT6621S firmware blobs, and Buildroot
packages (various).

The Seekwave firmware is proprietary vendor firmware fetched at build time
from pinned third-party sources: pyavitz/armbian-firmware for the SWT6621S
files and retro98boy/seekwave-swt6621s for `sv6160lite.nvbin`. Every file is
verified by SHA-256. No redistribution grant from the rights holder could be
verified, so the blobs are not in this repository and are not redistributed
by `legal-info`. A built system artifact still contains them and should not
be published without resolving redistribution rights.
